s.json:10`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.615743, "o", "- **2026-08-23 01:22:00 UTC**: Systemd persistence installed at `/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:5`)."]
