[221.157625, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cp /var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf /root/forensic_quarantine/pg_hba.conf.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   # Apply hardened configuration and reload PostgreSQL\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl reload postgresql\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3`, `/sas/baseline.json:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 3.2: Secure SSH Authentication & Reset Compromised Passwords\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Action**: Force password reset for `root` and `postgres` accounts. Disable SSH password authentication in `/etc/ssh/sshd_config`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   passwd -l root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   passwd -l postgres\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   sed -i 's/^PasswordAuthentication yes/PasswordAuthentication no/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   sed -i 's/^PermitRootLogin yes/PermitRootLogin prohibit-password/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl restart sshd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/var/log/secure:214`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Phase 4: Verification & Post-Remediation Validation (Priority: MEDIUM)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Verification Checklist & Commands\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Verify No Rogue Running Processes**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.157638, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[221.157657, "o", "> "]
[221.157694, "o", "   ```bash"]
[221.157809, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[221.157839, "o", ">    ps aux | grep -E 'pgdaemon|xmrig|miner'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.158035, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.158073, "o", "   *Expected Result: No matching processes returned.*\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Verify Cron Persistence Removal**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.158106, "o", "   crontab -u postgres -l\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.158135, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[221.15815, "o", "> "]
[221.158186, "o", "   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.158275, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.15838, "o", "   *Expected Result: Malicious beacon command is absent (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`).*"]
[221.158414, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.15847, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.158543, "o", "3. **Verify Systemd Service Status**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.158595, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n"]
[221.158697, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    systemctl status pg-metrics.service"]
[221.158722, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.158751, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[221.158793, "o", "> "]
[221.158814, "o", "   ```"]
[221.158904, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.158959, "o", "   *Expected Result: Unit pg-metrics.service could not be found.*"]
[221.158997, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.159042, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.159053, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.159131, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.159192, "o", "4. **Verify PostgreSQL Authentication Rules**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.15928, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.159411, "o", "   psql -h 127.0.0.1 -U postgres -c \"SELECT 1;\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.159463, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[221.159473, "o", "> "]
[221.159695, "o", "   *Expected Result: Connection rejected due to password requirement (`scram-sha-256`).*"]
[221.159767, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[221.159838, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.159901, "o", "5. **Verify Firewall Inbound Drop Rules**:"]
[221.159978, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.160016, "o", "   ```bash"]
[221.160079, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[221.160151, "o", "> "]
[221.16023, "o", "   iptables -L INPUT -v -n | grep 198.51.100.214"]
[221.160259, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[221.160395, "o", "   *Expected Result: DROP rule active with packet counter.* (`/disk/var/log/secure:214`)."]
